                "border_opacity": 100,
                "border_color": "",
                "border_radius": 0,
                "padding-block-start": 8,
                "padding-block-end": 8,
                "padding-inline-start": 0,
                "padding-inline-end": 0
              },
              "blocks": {
                "row_spec": {
                  "type": "_accordion-row",
                  "name": "t:names.accordion_row",
                  "settings": {
                    "heading": "What you get",
                    "open_by_default": true,
                    "icon": "check_box",
                    "width": 20
                  },
                  "blocks": {
                    "text-1": {
                      "type": "text",
                      "settings": {
                        "text": "<ul><li><strong>100 LEDs</strong> across the crown and hairline, in a duckbill cap shape for even coverage.</li><li><strong>Dual-band light</strong> &mdash; red and near-infrared, the two wavelengths used in low-level light therapy for the scalp.</li><li><strong>Infrared warmth</strong> &mdash; a gentle heat setting, like a warm compress.</li><li><strong>3 intensity levels</strong> so you can start low and build up.</li><li><strong>Soft, flexible shell</strong> that sits like a normal cap, not a piece of equipment.</li></ul>",
                        "width": "100%",
                        "max_width": "normal",
                        "alignment": "left",
                        "type_preset": "rte",
                        "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                        "font_size": "1rem",
                        "line_height": "normal",
                        "letter_spacing": "normal",
                        "case": "none",
                        "wrap": "pretty",
                        "text_color": "",
                        "background": false,
                        "background_color": "#00000026",
                        "corner_radius": 0,
                        "padding-block-start": 0,
                        "padding-block-end": 0,
                        "padding-inline-start": 0,
                        "padding-inline-end": 0
                      },
                      "blocks": {}
                    }
                  },
                  "block_order": [
                    "text-1"
                  ]
                },
                "row_why": {
                  "type": "_accordion-row",
                  "name": "t:names.accordion_row",
                  "settings": {
                    "heading": "Why a cap, not a helmet",
                    "open_by_default": false,
                    "icon": "question_mark",
                    "width": 20
                  },
                  "blocks": {
                    "text-1": {
                      "type": "text",
                      "settings": {
                        "text": "<p>Most light therapy devices are rigid domes you have to sit still under. Sitting still is the reason most people stop after three weeks.</p><p>HaloScalp is shaped like an ordinary cap, so the session fits into what you were already doing. The treatment people keep up with is the one that doesn't ask them to rearrange their evening.</p>",
                        "width": "100%",
                        "max_width": "normal",
                        "alignment": "left",
                        "type_preset": "rte",
                        "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                        "font_size": "1rem",
                        "line_height": "normal",
                        "letter_spacing": "normal",
                        "case": "none",
                        "wrap": "pretty",
                        "text_color": "",
                        "background": false,
                        "background_color": "#00000026",
                        "corner_radius": 0,
                        "padding-block-start": 0,
                        "padding-block-end": 0,
                        "padding-inline-start": 0,
                        "padding-inline-end": 0
                      },
                      "blocks": {}
                    }
                  },
                  "block_order": [
                    "text-1"
                  ]
                },
                "row_use": {
                  "type": "_accordion-row",
                  "name": "t:names.accordion_row",
                  "settings": {
                    "heading": "How to use it",
                    "open_by_default": false,
                    "icon": "stopwatch",
                    "width": 20
                  },
                  "blocks": {
                    "text-1": {
                      "type": "text",
                      "settings": {
                        "text": "<p>Put it on, choose one of the three intensity levels, and wear it while you get on with something else. Start low and build up as your scalp gets used to it.</p><p>A few sessions a week that you actually keep up will do more than an intensive fortnight followed by a drawer. Recommended timings are in the manual in the box.</p><p><a href=\"/pages/how-it-works\">Read the full routine</a></p>",
                        "width": "100%",
                        "max_width": "normal",
                        "alignment": "left",
                        "type_preset": "rte",
                        "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                        "font_size": "1rem",
                        "line_height": "normal",
                        "letter_spacing": "normal",
                        "case": "none",
                        "wrap": "pretty",
                        "text_color": "",
                        "background": false,
                        "background_color": "#00000026",
                        "corner_radius": 0,
                        "padding-block-start": 0,
                        "padding-block-end": 0,
                        "padding-inline-start": 0,
                        "padding-inline-end": 0
                      },
                      "blocks": {}
                    }
                  },
                  "block_order": [
                    "text-1"
                  ]
                },
                "row_box": {
                  "type": "_accordion-row",
                  "name": "t:names.accordion_row",
                  "settings": {
                    "heading": "What&rsquo;s in the box",
                    "open_by_default": false,
                    "icon": "box",
                    "width": 20
                  },
                  "blocks": {
                    "text-1": {
                      "type": "text",
                      "settings": {
                        "text": "<ul><li>HaloScalp LED cap &times; 1</li><li>Charging cable &times; 1</li><li>User manual &times; 1</li></ul><p>Nothing else to buy, nothing to assemble.</p>",
                        "width": "100%",
                        "max_width": "normal",
                        "alignment": "left",
                        "type_preset": "rte",
                        "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                        "font_size": "1rem",
                        "line_height": "normal",
                        "letter_spacing": "normal",
                        "case": "none",
                        "wrap": "pretty",
                        "text_color": "",
                        "background": false,
                        "background_color": "#00000026",
                        "corner_radius": 0,
                        "padding-block-start": 0,
                        "padding-block-end": 0,
                        "padding-inline-start": 0,
                        "padding-inline-end": 0
                      },
                      "blocks": {}
                    }
                  },
                  "block_order": [
                    "text-1"
                  ]
                },
                "row_delivery": {
                  "type": "_accordion-row",
                  "name": "t:names.accordion_row",
                  "settings": {
                    "heading": "Delivery &amp; returns",
                    "open_by_default": false,
                    "icon": "truck",
                    "width": 20
                  },
                  "blocks": {
                    "text-1": {
                      "type": "text",
                      "settings": {
                        "text": "<p>Dispatched within 1&ndash;2 business days. After that, roughly 7&ndash;18 business days across Europe and the UK, and 10&ndash;20 business days further afield.</p><p>Delivery cost is calculated at checkout before you pay. You have a 14-day legal right to cancel and a 30-day return window on top of it. If it arrives faulty, we cover the return postage.</p><p><a href=\"/pages/shipping\">Shipping detail</a> &middot; <a href=\"/pages/returns\">Returns policy</a></p>",
                        "width": "100%",
                        "max_width": "normal",
                        "alignment": "left",
                        "type_preset": "rte",
                        "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                        "font_size": "1rem",
                        "line_height": "normal",
                        "letter_spacing": "normal",
                        "case": "none",
                        "wrap": "pretty",
                        "text_color": "",
                        "background": false,
                        "background_color": "#00000026",
                        "corner_radius": 0,
                        "padding-block-start": 0,
                        "padding-block-end": 0,
                        "padding-inline-start": 0,
                        "padding-inline-end": 0
                      },
                      "blocks": {}
                    }
                  },
                  "block_order": [
                    "text-1"
                  ]
                },
                "row_safety": {
                  "type": "_accordion-row",
                  "name": "t:names.accordion_row",
                  "settings": {
                    "heading": "Results &amp; safety",
                    "open_by_default": false,
                    "icon": "heart",
                    "width": 20
                  },
                  "blocks": {
                    "text-1": {
                      "type": "text",
                      "settings": {
                        "text": "<p>Light therapy is gradual, not dramatic. This is a supportive addition to a scalp care routine &mdash; <strong>not a medical device</strong>, not a guaranteed fix, and not a substitute for medical advice. Results vary considerably, and some people will see little or no change.</p><p>If hair loss is causing you real concern, talk to a GP or dermatologist. There are clinically established treatments, and a light therapy cap is not one of them.</p><p>Do not look directly into the LEDs. Check with a doctor first if you have a scalp condition, are photosensitive, take medication that increases light sensitivity, or are pregnant. Not intended for children.</p>",
                        "width": "100%",
                        "max_width": "normal",
                        "alignment": "left",
                        "type_preset": "rte",
                        "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                        "font_size": "1rem",
                        "line_height": "normal",
                        "letter_spacing": "normal",
                        "case": "none",
                        "wrap": "pretty",
                        "text_color": "",
                        "background": false,
                        "background_color": "#00000026",
                        "corner_radius": 0,
                        "padding-block-start": 0,
                        "padding-block-end": 0,
                        "padding-inline-start": 0,
                        "padding-inline-end": 0
                      },
                      "blocks": {}
                    }
                  },
                  "block_order": [
                    "text-1"
                  ]
                }
              },
              "block_order": [
                "row_spec",
                "row_why",
                "row_use",
                "row_box",
                "row_delivery",
                "row_safety"
              ]
            },
            "video_section": {
              "type": "custom-liquid",
              "name": "t:names.custom_liquid",
              "settings": {
                "custom_liquid": "{%- assign pr = closest.product | default: product -%}\n{%- assign v_native = pr.media | where: 'media_type', 'video' -%}\n{%- assign v_ext = pr.media | where: 'media_type', 'external_video' -%}\n{%- assign v_all = v_native | concat: v_ext -%}\n{%- comment -%}\n  Up to three videos attached to the product as media. Add them in Shopify\n  admin under Products - this product - Media (an uploaded file, or a\n  YouTube/Vimeo URL) and they appear here automatically. With none attached\n  this renders nothing, so the live page never shows an empty placeholder.\n{%- endcomment -%}\n{%- if v_all.size > 0 -%}\n<section class=\"hs-vids\" aria-label=\"Product videos\">\n  <h2 class=\"hs-vids__title\">See it in use</h2>\n  <ul class=\"hs-vids__list\">\n    {%- for m in v_all limit: 3 -%}\n      <li class=\"hs-vids__item\">\n        <div class=\"hs-vids__frame\">\n          {{ m | media_tag: controls: true, preload: 'metadata', image_size: '1000x' }}\n        </div>\n        {%- if m.alt != blank -%}<p class=\"hs-vids__cap\">{{ m.alt | escape }}</p>{%- endif -%}\n      </li>\n    {%- endfor -%}\n  </ul>\n</section>\n{%- endif -%}"
              },
              "blocks": {}
            }
          },
          "block_order": [
            "text_tefwj7",
            "price_a7krng",
            "variant_picker_R3rGDr",
            "buy_buttons_eYQEYi",
            "video_section",
            "text_gXMUag",
            "accordion_sections"
          ]
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "disclosures_mbYemM"
      ],
      "settings": {
        "content_width": "content-center-aligned",
        "desktop_media_position": "left",
        "equal_columns": false,
        "limit_details_width": false,
        "gap": 8,
        "enable_sticky_add_to_cart": true,
        "background_color": "{{ settings.color_palette.background }}",
        "padding-block-start": 0,
        "padding-block-end": 0
      }
    },
    "gallery_fit_css": {
      "type": "custom-liquid",
      "settings": {
        "custom_liquid": "{{ 'hs-product.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}\n<script>window.HS_PRICE = {{ product.price | money | json }};</script>\n<script src=\"{{ 'hs-product.js' | asset_url }}\" defer></script>",
        "background_color": "",
        "section_width": "page-width",
